# LOCAL override for the tile links (used by `npm run dev`).
#
# Normally you don't need this file: locally the portal works the links out itself
# (laptop → localhost:5174…, SAP BAS → port5174-workspaces-…).
#
# To make your local portal open a DEPLOYED app instead:
#   1. copy this file to `.env` (same folder — it's git-ignored, so it's only for you)
#   2. fill in the URL (keep the trailing slash)
#   3. RESTART `npm run dev` (Vite only reads .env when it starts)
#
# Deployed links for the real deployment live in `.env.production`.
VITE_ASN_URL=
VITE_SCHEDULE_RELEASE_URL=
VITE_PURCHASE_ORDER_URL=
